.SH NAME
SystemEx.Numeric.BigDecimal \- Represents an arbitrary‑precision decimal number stored in scientific notation using a BigInteger mantissa and a base‑10 exponent\&.  

.SH SYNOPSIS
.br
.PP
.PP
Inherits IComparable, IComparable, and IEquatable\&.
